&lt;h2&gt;Clearer OpenSSH connection setup&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See the alias name and resolved connection values directly in the form, with each value ready to edit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Name connections at the top&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The connection name appears above the destination and defaults to the selected OpenSSH alias.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Edit resolved OpenSSH values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hostname or IP, user, port, and identity are filled into their fields instead of gray placeholders. The alias remains active for alias-specific SSH rules.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Switch to a direct address&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Choose Use address to replace the alias destination with its resolved hostname or IP.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.6"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
